  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "While Dancer Hong Yun advances under Thousand Transformations’ will, rank eight Immortal Gu Mutation turns an ancient soul beast’s attack into a cascade of mismatched lifeforms, and she names that power as rank eight mutation Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1412
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_dancer_hong_yun",
          "char_thousand_transformations_ancestor"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the next stretch of the same fight, the Gu activates again and forces claws and teeth to grow into ancient desolate plants.",
        "chapters": [
          1413
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Thousand Transformations Ancestor inherited a Reckless Savage true inheritance with mutation Immortal Gu as its core. Without it, most of those methods become hard to use and much weaker.",
        "chapters": [
          1872
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "core-of-reckless-savage-inheritance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "inh_reckless_savage_true_inheritance"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan snatches mutation Immortal Gu from the dream realm that held it with Dancer Hong Yun, then leaves with Myriad Year Flying Warship while Thousand Transformations Ancestor tries to kill him for the theft.",
        "chapters": [
          1875
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-seizes-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
